      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in a place of deep exhaustion and pain, and I want you to know that those feelings are incredibly heavy to carry. Please challenge the idea that you are \"broken\"; what you are describing sounds like the profound impact of enduring immense difficulty for a very long time. It is possible, even if it feels impossible now, to find a path to self-re-definition and gentle healing, not by \"fixing\" what you think is gone, but by tending to the person who is here right now. If you are in crisis, please reach out to a mental health professional or a crisis hotline immediately for support.",
